          "text" : "Declare @Market Varchar(10), @GRGR_CK Varchar(10)\nSET @GRGR_CK = @0\nSET @Market = @1\n\nIF @GRGR_CK = '' AND @Market = ''\nSELECT TOP 1 @Market = VALUE1, @GRGR_CK = GRGR_CK FROM DBO.EDI_A2A_SelectionCriteria  where CODETYPE = 'MarketCode' and VALUE2 < FORMAT(DATEADD(MONTH, DATEDIFF(MONTH, 0, GETDATE()), 0),'yyyyMMdd')\nORDER BY GRGR_CK\n\nELSE IF @GRGR_CK != ''\nSELECT TOP 1 @Market = VALUE1, @GRGR_CK = GRGR_CK FROM DBO.EDI_A2A_SelectionCriteria  where CODETYPE = 'MarketCode' and (GRGR_CK = @GRGR_CK OR VALUE1 = @Market)\n\nELSE\nSELECT TOP 1 @Market = VALUE1, @GRGR_CK = GRGR_CK FROM DBO.EDI_A2A_SelectionCriteria  where CODETYPE = 'MarketCode' and (GRGR_CK = @GRGR_CK OR VALUE1 = @Market)\n\nSELECT  @Market  Market,@GRGR_CK GRGR_CK"
